{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Estimated Playtime: Around 1 hour</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Genre: Short Exploration Horror Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a school at night in this <strong>exploration horror adventure</strong>.<br>Take control of a young girl, the protagonist, and guide her through the unfolding story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to act as you wish throughout the game, and <strong>the ending will change depending on your choices</strong>.<br>Will you be able to reach the final conclusion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four high school students visit their school at night for a <strong>test of courage</strong>, wandering from classroom to classroom.<br>They came prepared with ghost stories, ready to enjoy the eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of one of the students, <strong>Rin Kowaka</strong>, and follow the events that unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe <strong>nothing happened</strong>...<br>Or maybe <strong>something did</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fleeting moment from an ordinary high school life \u2014 or so it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Streaming &amp; Videos</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>no restrictions</strong> on video content or live streaming of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No permission is required to create content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If possible, please include the <strong>game title</strong> and <strong>Steam store page link</strong> in your video description or stream details.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u5c4b\u4e0a\u306e\u5e7d\u970a\u306e\u602a\u8ac7\u3092\u4f53\u9a13\u3057\u305f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2706710/374296472ca6d8009c2241413bc52b946cbb405f.jpg"}],"total":1},"backgroun